WEBVTT

00:00:01.325 --> 00:00:10.393
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:20.134
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.244 --> 00:00:29.949
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:39.356
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:39.763 --> 00:00:49.900
<i>I look back...
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:50.908 --> 00:00:56.869
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:00.481
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:00.651 --> 00:01:06.317
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.456 --> 00:01:09.983
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:19.159
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:38.620
Come all, come see!

00:01:38.722 --> 00:01:42.590
If you're not busy or in a hurry,
come and have a look!

00:01:42.693 --> 00:01:46.424
This sword here brings cold
in the heat of summer...

00:01:46.563 --> 00:01:50.693
One becomes two, two become four,
four become eight...

00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:54.770
...and eight become sixteen,
sixteen become thirty two...

00:01:54.871 --> 00:02:01.299
...thirty two become sixty four,
and sixty four... Um, uh...

00:02:01.478 --> 00:02:03.447
One hundred and twenty eight...

00:02:03.447 --> 00:02:05.415
<i>One hundred and twenty eight!
One hundred and twenty eight...</i>

00:02:06.116 --> 00:02:08.243
Look, just like that!

00:02:08.418 --> 00:02:10.943
It comes down just like snow!

00:02:11.088 --> 00:02:14.524
Wow, that's great! Go, Yatchan!

00:02:14.992 --> 00:02:16.960
This famous sword here...

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.995
I will stop it with my bare hands!

00:02:20.664 --> 00:02:23.599
This is called "Shinken Shiraha-dori"!

00:02:24.468 --> 00:02:25.435
Rushuna...

00:02:25.802 --> 00:02:26.996
Hey, Rushuna?

00:02:27.471 --> 00:02:28.631
That's your cue!

00:02:28.739 --> 00:02:31.105
What? I have to do it?

00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:34.439
Of course! Who else is there?

00:02:35.479 --> 00:02:40.781
Now, this young lady will
swing this sword at me!

00:02:41.318 --> 00:02:44.287
I've never even held a sword before.

00:02:44.388 --> 00:02:46.117
Just do it!

00:02:46.256 --> 00:02:50.522
If we don't do it we can't eat,
and we can't take a bath either!

00:02:50.994 --> 00:02:52.120
Okay.

00:02:52.396 --> 00:02:53.693
Here goes!

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:54.728
Come!

00:03:00.871 --> 00:03:04.068
This is an amazing sword!

00:03:04.207 --> 00:03:07.142
You idiot! You swung at me for real!

00:03:07.244 --> 00:03:08.040
Huh?

00:03:08.378 --> 00:03:10.608
You told me to swing at you!

00:03:10.714 --> 00:03:13.046
No! Not like that!

00:03:14.518 --> 00:03:17.214
Look at your face!

00:03:17.354 --> 00:03:19.447
You're weird!

00:03:19.623 --> 00:03:22.524
You're the only one laughing.

00:03:22.859 --> 00:03:25.089
They're laughing.

00:03:26.596 --> 00:03:30.088
<i>Episode 4
The Town That Does Not Smile</i>

00:03:30.901 --> 00:03:31.629
Hah...

00:03:31.768 --> 00:03:34.601
Rushuna, they're all looking at us!

00:03:34.971 --> 00:03:37.872
Oh! Did you all enjoy that?

00:03:40.711 --> 00:03:41.302
Uh...

00:03:41.445 --> 00:03:43.379
Hey, wait!

00:03:43.647 --> 00:03:46.445
We'll give you a proper show!

00:03:46.983 --> 00:03:50.544
Yatchan, I'm hungry.

00:03:51.154 --> 00:03:53.714
We have to do this or we can't eat.

00:03:53.824 --> 00:03:58.488
But we haven't eaten in four days!

00:03:58.995 --> 00:04:03.694
Don't cry! The life of an entertainer
is tough! Do it right this time!

00:04:03.967 --> 00:04:06.231
I'm not an entertainer.

00:04:06.703 --> 00:04:10.537
We have to perform for money
or we can't eat!

00:04:10.674 --> 00:04:14.542
But no one's amused and we
haven't made a penny!

00:04:14.678 --> 00:04:18.239
We're going to make money
starting now! We're doing it again!

00:04:18.382 --> 00:04:19.474
No.

00:04:19.583 --> 00:04:21.915
What do you mean, no! Just do it!

00:04:22.018 --> 00:04:24.953
I can't unless I eat something.

00:04:25.088 --> 00:04:28.251
We're doing this so
we can get some food!

00:04:28.392 --> 00:04:30.792
Yatchan, you do it alone.

00:04:30.894 --> 00:04:32.191
Alone?

00:04:32.396 --> 00:04:34.330
What choice do I have.

00:04:34.464 --> 00:04:38.230
Hey there mister,
let me show you something.

00:04:38.335 --> 00:04:41.099
Hey there miss! Please, just watch!

00:04:46.209 --> 00:04:50.373
What's up with the people in this town?
They're all ignoring us!

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.971
Don't they have any sympathy!

00:04:53.083 --> 00:04:56.211
Forget this. Let's go to the next town.

00:05:04.694 --> 00:05:07.527
You want to stay here for a while?

00:05:07.764 --> 00:05:08.492
Yes.

00:05:08.698 --> 00:05:12.099
Why? We're going to starve to death.

00:05:12.269 --> 00:05:14.897
We can live without food for another day.

00:05:15.071 --> 00:05:17.938
It's a shame we can't take a bath, but...

00:05:18.041 --> 00:05:21.533
Yeah, we haven't had a bath in a while.

00:05:22.479 --> 00:05:26.540
It bothers me that the
people here don't smile.

00:05:26.716 --> 00:05:27.774
Smile?

00:05:28.084 --> 00:05:30.109
Food comes first!

00:05:30.353 --> 00:05:31.684
Yatchan...

00:05:32.456 --> 00:05:33.218
Hmm?

00:05:38.829 --> 00:05:42.492
Once I have some food in my stomach,
I'll smile all you want.

00:05:42.599 --> 00:05:43.623
Here is...

00:05:43.733 --> 00:05:44.563
Huh?

00:05:44.701 --> 00:05:46.032
...food.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.004
This is great!

00:05:54.277 --> 00:05:57.178
I guess they're not all bad.

00:05:57.814 --> 00:05:59.008
You're right.

00:05:59.182 --> 00:06:03.141
I guess this means they
want to see more of my act.

00:06:04.354 --> 00:06:06.618
Is she ignoring me?

00:06:06.723 --> 00:06:09.521
But why sneak this to us?

00:06:09.659 --> 00:06:14.062
Clear the roads!
The Great Senshi is coming!

00:06:15.532 --> 00:06:18.228
Get out of the way, kid!
Get back in your house!

00:06:18.335 --> 00:06:21.429
You too! Get out of the way!

00:06:29.145 --> 00:06:30.009
Hey!

00:06:30.647 --> 00:06:33.582
Who just laughed?

00:06:33.717 --> 00:06:34.809
You?

00:06:34.918 --> 00:06:38.319
No it wasn't me. It was him!

00:06:47.264 --> 00:06:51.758
I'm the only one who gets
to laugh in this town!

00:06:52.002 --> 00:06:53.663
I'm sorry!

00:06:58.808 --> 00:07:01.504
All who break the rules will be killed.

00:07:01.611 --> 00:07:04.546
Take double what we normally do!

00:07:04.681 --> 00:07:05.613
Yes sir!

00:07:05.749 --> 00:07:08.183
Give us your earnings for the day!

00:07:08.285 --> 00:07:09.274
Yes, sir.

00:07:09.519 --> 00:07:12.010
Is that all you made?

00:07:12.155 --> 00:07:17.149
You need to work harder or do you
want me to give you some incentive?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.887
Please, forgive me!

00:07:19.029 --> 00:07:21.293
Hurry, up, out with it!

00:07:21.898 --> 00:07:22.762
Boss!

00:07:25.268 --> 00:07:26.030
What?

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.428
Hatagoya!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:34.468
Um, we've already made
our payment for the day.

00:07:34.711 --> 00:07:35.973
Not yet!

00:07:36.112 --> 00:07:39.707
I hear that there were street
performers in front of your store today.

00:07:39.783 --> 00:07:40.511
Yes.

00:07:40.617 --> 00:07:45.577
But they disappeared without a trace,
and I don't think they made any money.

00:07:45.889 --> 00:07:47.914
Did you collect rent?

00:07:47.991 --> 00:07:49.356
No, I didn't.

00:07:49.459 --> 00:07:51.757
Idiot! Why didn't you charge them?

00:07:51.861 --> 00:07:55.888
If they're performing in front of your
shop, it's common sense to collect rent!

00:07:55.999 --> 00:07:59.491
I'm sorry. It won't...
It won't happen again!

00:08:21.191 --> 00:08:22.215
Wait!

00:08:23.193 --> 00:08:26.287
I can't eat anymore.

00:08:30.233 --> 00:08:35.034
Yatchan, she brought us breakfast too.

00:08:42.979 --> 00:08:48.110
Come all, come see! If you're not busy,
come around and have a look!

00:08:48.251 --> 00:08:55.180
She will shoot a persimmon top off
this famous sword in one shot!

00:08:55.825 --> 00:08:57.190
Hey, Rushuna!

00:08:57.694 --> 00:08:58.786
Do it!

00:08:58.928 --> 00:08:59.690
Huh?

00:09:00.664 --> 00:09:01.631
Sure...

00:09:01.731 --> 00:09:04.131
Just show off a bit!

00:09:04.601 --> 00:09:05.329
Okay.

00:09:05.435 --> 00:09:07.596
Hurry up and shoot it!

00:09:11.508 --> 00:09:12.202
Shoot!

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:15.040
Fast...

00:09:21.918 --> 00:09:25.012
What do you think? Amazing, wasn't it?

00:09:25.355 --> 00:09:27.380
We can do it again!

00:09:28.091 --> 00:09:29.251
Miss...

00:09:29.592 --> 00:09:32.060
Here, take this.

00:09:34.297 --> 00:09:36.731
So it was you...

00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:37.861
Please.

00:09:38.635 --> 00:09:40.227
Thank you.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:41.466
Um...

00:09:42.405 --> 00:09:44.999
Are you strong?

00:09:45.408 --> 00:09:46.067
Huh?

00:09:46.176 --> 00:09:48.770
Ai, what are you doing?

00:09:50.046 --> 00:09:53.015
Enough playing. Go back to the shop.

00:09:53.116 --> 00:09:53.946
But...

00:09:54.384 --> 00:09:56.944
We can't have you doing this here.

00:09:57.187 --> 00:10:00.953
Please, you must leave at once.
If you don't...

00:10:01.091 --> 00:10:02.058
Oh...

00:10:05.328 --> 00:10:06.386
Daddy!

00:10:06.529 --> 00:10:07.257
Honey!

00:10:08.198 --> 00:10:09.756
So it's you!

00:10:10.233 --> 00:10:12.895
Taking liberties in this town!

00:10:13.069 --> 00:10:14.900
Who are you!

00:10:15.305 --> 00:10:18.570
I am the Great Senshi
who protects this town.

00:10:18.675 --> 00:10:20.506
Great Senshi?

00:10:20.777 --> 00:10:25.942
We're the only ones allowed to
fire off anything that makes noise!

00:10:27.317 --> 00:10:29.649
And only we can laugh, too.

00:10:29.753 --> 00:10:34.520
I'm sorry, we took liberties,
even though you're here.

00:10:34.991 --> 00:10:37.619
You're quick to get the picture.

00:10:37.761 --> 00:10:39.129
So hand it over.

00:10:39.129 --> 00:10:39.823
Huh?
So hand it over.

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:42.960
<i>This guy here?
Hand it over.</i>

00:10:43.099 --> 00:10:43.929
Huh?

00:10:44.067 --> 00:10:46.331
Your rent, your rent!

00:10:46.469 --> 00:10:51.771
We're doing this because we've got no
money. We have nothing to give you!

00:10:52.709 --> 00:10:56.167
Not only do these people have no
money...

00:10:56.312 --> 00:11:00.271
...they have no manners nor the
proper respect for the Great Senshi.

00:11:00.383 --> 00:11:02.510
Could you tell?

00:11:09.793 --> 00:11:14.594
I think we need to teach you
who's in charge here.

00:11:14.831 --> 00:11:17.561
You take care of him.

00:11:18.434 --> 00:11:21.528
I'll teach the girl myself.

00:11:21.704 --> 00:11:24.901
Oh, I wonder what's
going to happen to me?

00:11:25.041 --> 00:11:27.032
I'm so scared, I'm shaking!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.399
Do it!

00:11:37.554 --> 00:11:39.021
Are you okay?

00:11:39.122 --> 00:11:40.680
Why didn't you shoot?

00:11:40.824 --> 00:11:42.655
There's a child watching.

00:11:42.759 --> 00:11:44.784
This isn't the time for that!

00:11:44.894 --> 00:11:48.728
They're out of control. They talk
like they're protecting the town...

00:11:48.965 --> 00:11:51.092
...but they're the ones shooting it up.

00:11:51.234 --> 00:11:55.762
There's nowhere to run!
If you value your lives, come out.

00:11:55.905 --> 00:11:58.601
And kneel before me.

00:11:58.942 --> 00:12:00.671
Listen to them.

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:02.471
Poor things.

00:12:02.745 --> 00:12:07.808
They're outcast senshi with no place
to go, that's why they're doing this.

00:12:09.052 --> 00:12:11.111
It's because of their guns.

00:12:11.387 --> 00:12:17.087
Senshi think that just because
they have guns, they have power.

00:12:18.094 --> 00:12:22.121
They think that if they shoot,
people will kneel before them.

00:12:22.298 --> 00:12:26.701
The weight of a human life is
no more than that of a trigger.

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:30.503
That's why I hate senshi.

00:12:32.475 --> 00:12:33.134
Yatchan!

00:12:47.457 --> 00:12:48.685
Why'd you do that?

00:12:48.791 --> 00:12:50.088
Yatchan, no.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:50.954
Huh?

00:12:51.227 --> 00:12:55.425
Our goal as street performers is
to get people to have a good time...

00:12:55.565 --> 00:12:57.795
...if we don't, they won't laugh.

00:12:58.735 --> 00:13:01.226
An act that will make people laugh?

00:13:01.337 --> 00:13:04.306
That's good. Let's see it.

00:13:04.774 --> 00:13:05.570
Sure.

00:13:27.931 --> 00:13:30.900
Go ahead, make us laugh.

00:13:31.034 --> 00:13:33.696
I'd like to begin, then.

00:13:35.805 --> 00:13:38.433
Hey, Shiny Top Tengu!

00:13:38.608 --> 00:13:40.439
Shiny Top?

00:13:42.378 --> 00:13:45.040
That's a wig right? On your head!

00:13:45.148 --> 00:13:46.979
It's so obvious!

00:13:48.084 --> 00:13:51.349
Are you laughing at me? A wig?

00:13:51.454 --> 00:13:53.354
A Bald Dome...

00:14:04.767 --> 00:14:07.736
Mr. Bald Dome is doing a bad thing.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:12.204
He's supposed to be protecting the
town, but instead, he's causing trouble.

00:14:12.308 --> 00:14:13.639
That's not good!

00:14:15.712 --> 00:14:19.079
I'll punish bad people like this.

00:14:19.182 --> 00:14:20.979
Girl!

00:14:21.117 --> 00:14:23.517
You won't get away with this!

00:14:23.686 --> 00:14:24.744
Oh...

00:14:25.355 --> 00:14:29.519
This is a rokumonsen, a rapid fire
gun that can shoot 200 rounds!

00:14:29.625 --> 00:14:31.525
<i>Unrivaled rapid fire gun
Rokumonsen!</i>

00:14:31.627 --> 00:14:34.460
Have a taste of 200 rapid fire rounds!

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:40.565
Two hundred rounds... That's amazing.

00:14:41.004 --> 00:14:43.837
Then I will stop you with just one shot.

00:14:44.007 --> 00:14:45.838
With just one shot.

00:14:47.877 --> 00:14:49.401
Give me a break!

00:15:20.109 --> 00:15:21.542
Impossible!

00:15:21.677 --> 00:15:29.083
Even before I was able to pull the trigger,
she blew the rod out of rokumonsen.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:35.256
And with just one shot... This girl...

00:15:35.825 --> 00:15:37.690
Who is she?

00:15:38.961 --> 00:15:43.193
What are you doing? Hurry up...

00:15:45.368 --> 00:15:48.201
Don't worry, I didn't kill them.

00:15:48.371 --> 00:15:49.633
Crap.

00:15:51.007 --> 00:15:54.204
We have one more act,
would you like to see it?

00:16:08.991 --> 00:16:10.925
Wow, you're amazing!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.891
Did you have a good time?

00:16:12.995 --> 00:16:13.825
Yeah!

00:16:14.931 --> 00:16:17.661
I wanted to see that smile.

00:16:30.913 --> 00:16:32.107
Yatchan...

00:16:32.215 --> 00:16:33.307
What?

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:37.315
What you said earlier, it hurt.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.249
What did I say?

00:16:39.355 --> 00:16:44.918
Senshi think that the weight of human life
is no more than that of a trigger.

00:16:47.597 --> 00:16:50.828
Forget it. I wasn't talking about you.

00:16:52.368 --> 00:16:57.067
But that's why you chose to
fight with a sword, right?

00:16:59.375 --> 00:17:03.744
A swordsman grips the sword with his
hand and cuts through flesh and bone.

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:06.348
You feel it in your hands.

00:17:07.049 --> 00:17:10.780
You feel the weight of life
in the palm of your hand.

00:17:10.887 --> 00:17:12.855
<i>Tanagokoro
The palm of one's hand</i>

00:17:19.362 --> 00:17:21.796
It would turn you into a monster.

00:17:22.265 --> 00:17:23.095
Huh?

00:17:23.499 --> 00:17:26.696
The lives and thoughts
of those I killed...

00:17:26.802 --> 00:17:31.762
If I were to absorb them all through
my hands, I would become a monster.

00:17:31.908 --> 00:17:33.466
A monster...

00:17:33.576 --> 00:17:37.706
I think I was starting to become one...

00:17:38.514 --> 00:17:40.948
...until I met you.

00:17:42.251 --> 00:17:47.848
It would be best not to use
a sword nor a gun...

00:17:49.825 --> 00:17:50.723
Yatchan!

00:17:53.629 --> 00:17:54.653
Yatchan!

00:17:56.332 --> 00:17:57.959
What's wrong?

00:18:00.303 --> 00:18:03.704
Don't worry, I think he got overheated.

00:18:06.976 --> 00:18:11.845
You see, we'd like you to become
the protectors of this town.

00:18:11.948 --> 00:18:13.176
Protectors?

00:18:13.683 --> 00:18:14.274
Yes.

00:18:14.383 --> 00:18:19.616
In these times of war and chaos, if people
like you could watch over our town.

00:18:19.722 --> 00:18:22.247
Of course, we would compensate you.

00:18:22.358 --> 00:18:23.985
Please stay.

00:18:24.093 --> 00:18:25.219
Please!

00:18:25.928 --> 00:18:31.867
But we're traveling performers.
We just wanted to see you smile.

00:18:31.968 --> 00:18:33.435
That's right!

00:18:33.769 --> 00:18:36.897
Please don't look so worried.

00:18:38.274 --> 00:18:42.540
If you greet everyone who comes
to town with your smiles...

00:18:42.678 --> 00:18:45.408
...there will be no more fighting.

00:18:45.514 --> 00:18:46.538
But...

00:18:47.183 --> 00:18:50.482
This is also the wish of Tenshi.

00:18:51.487 --> 00:18:52.715
Tenshi?

00:18:53.222 --> 00:18:54.348
Tenshi?

00:18:54.857 --> 00:18:55.619
Yes.

00:18:55.791 --> 00:18:59.727
She told me that if everyone
believes in each other and...

00:18:59.829 --> 00:19:03.230
...if everyone smiles,
then war will come to an end.

00:19:03.366 --> 00:19:04.628
I see.

00:19:05.434 --> 00:19:07.493
Then I'm going to smile!

00:19:10.673 --> 00:19:11.503
Ai...

00:19:11.674 --> 00:19:15.075
It's been a long time since
I've seen Ai laugh like that.

00:19:16.312 --> 00:19:17.370
Is it weird?

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.174
No, it's wonderful.

00:19:20.516 --> 00:19:22.882
Daddy, everyone, laugh!

00:19:31.861 --> 00:19:35.888
She can't be associated with Tenshi...

00:19:40.236 --> 00:19:44.070
As I thought, something must be done...

00:19:55.918 --> 00:19:59.581
Yatchan, what's wrong?
Why are you so quiet?

00:19:59.955 --> 00:20:03.823
Well, there's something
I need to ask you.

00:20:03.926 --> 00:20:04.585
What?

00:20:05.661 --> 00:20:08.630
Do you have anything to do with Tenshi?

00:20:09.699 --> 00:20:13.692
I believe that Tenshi is the reason
behind these troubled times.

00:20:13.936 --> 00:20:19.897
So long as those in power don't
do anything, war will never end!

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:25.369
If you have anything to do with Tenshi...

00:20:29.018 --> 00:20:29.950
You!

00:20:30.486 --> 00:20:32.249
Yatchan, behind you!

00:20:32.355 --> 00:20:33.151
What!

00:20:33.489 --> 00:20:36.014
Shoot them, shoot them! Shoot them
dead!

00:20:38.361 --> 00:20:40.989
They were waiting for us! Rushuna!

00:20:53.843 --> 00:20:56.004
Haven't you had enough?

00:20:56.145 --> 00:20:59.603
First you embarrass me, then this?

00:20:59.715 --> 00:21:00.477
Do it!

00:21:00.783 --> 00:21:03.684
You must not take your life so lightly.

00:21:05.321 --> 00:21:07.482
5,000 gold coins!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:12.486
That's the price on your head!
I wouldn't do this otherwise!

00:21:12.762 --> 00:21:14.889
Oh, that's a mistake.

00:21:14.997 --> 00:21:15.986
Look!

00:21:27.777 --> 00:21:29.005
Yatchan.

00:21:29.512 --> 00:21:31.605
I had no choice.

00:21:33.449 --> 00:21:34.973
Let me see.

00:21:36.786 --> 00:21:38.686
That's some wanted poster.

00:21:38.821 --> 00:21:41.949
It's got your face and
your name clear as day on it.

00:21:42.091 --> 00:21:44.286
And it's got a seal on it.

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:46.428
What does this mean?

00:21:46.862 --> 00:21:48.489
Why me?

00:21:48.631 --> 00:21:49.859
I wonder...

00:21:49.999 --> 00:21:54.959
Tenshi's been turned against you.
That means you're my friend.

00:21:55.237 --> 00:21:56.067
What?

00:22:15.591 --> 00:22:25.227
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:26.302 --> 00:22:35.973
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:37.279 --> 00:22:42.512
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:42.685 --> 00:22:46.746
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:47.823 --> 00:22:55.559
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:55.898 --> 00:22:57.991
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:58.267 --> 00:23:03.398
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:03.606 --> 00:23:09.044
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.245 --> 00:23:19.246
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:19.588 --> 00:23:30.396
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:30.566 --> 00:23:41.170
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:43.312 --> 00:23:45.280
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:45.381 --> 00:23:50.148
Tenshi put a bounty on me?
It must be a mistake.

00:23:50.419 --> 00:23:54.412
We hide ourselves at Toukarou,
an inn in the red light district.

00:23:54.557 --> 00:23:57.253
A fugitive is causing problems here?

00:23:57.359 --> 00:24:02.797
Ask my body... I, Rushuna Tendo,
haven't done anything wrong.

00:24:03.132 --> 00:24:09.696
Next episode of "Grenadier",
Explosion, Kensousen, Kurenai Touka.

00:24:09.872 --> 00:24:12.272
Would you like to join me?
